---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Andy Araya"
  description="Privacy Policy for Andy Araya's personal website and related personal applications."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="noise-layer pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-35"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-cyan-200/70">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-white/72">
        <p>Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how Andy Araya's personal website and related personal applications handle information.
          The website is primarily informational and does not directly ask visitors to create an account, submit forms, or provide personal information.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Information Collected</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not intentionally collect personal information from visitors. Basic technical information, such as browser type,
          device information, IP address, and page visits, may be processed by hosting, analytics, security, or infrastructure providers to operate,
          secure, and improve the site.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Use Of Information</h2>
        <p>
          Any technical information processed by service providers is used only for site operation, security, troubleshooting, performance,
          and basic usage understanding. It is not sold or used for advertising by this website.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          The website may rely on third-party platforms such as Cloudflare, GitHub, Google Cloud, or similar services for hosting,
          authentication, infrastructure, or development purposes. Those services may process information according to their own privacy policies.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Google User Data</h2>
        <p>
          If a related personal application uses Google APIs, it will only request access needed for its stated purpose. Google user data is not sold,
          shared for advertising, or used beyond the functionality requested by the user.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this Privacy Policy can be sent to
          <a class="text-cyan-200 transition hover:text-white" href="mailto:andyarayacr@gmail.com">andyarayacr@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
